# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Documentation

## Start here

Open [Feature Status](engineering/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md) to see what works, what remains, and the next action for each feature. Follow its links for detailed decisions and evidence.

## Source-of-truth order

1. `AGENTS.md` — repository safety and agent rules.
2. `product/PRODUCT_BRIEF.md` — users, problem, outcomes, scope.
3. `design/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` and `design/FLOW_AND_SCREEN_SPEC.md` — experience and state acceptance.
4. `engineering/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `engineering/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` — technical decisions and delivery.
5. Active feature packet — current scoped handoff.
6. `engineering/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md` — one concise feature overview with verified facts and links to detail.
7. `operations/HANDOFF.md` — current operational context.

## Workflow

```text
discovery
→ design-ready
→ code-ready
→ in-progress
→ verification
→ accepted
→ released
```

